Independent witness, outside the suites: add one signed pending successor in a second fixture commit, then query the supported reverse range second..first. The successor is absent from the latter store, so removed must contain its id. Actual CLI and actual stdio warrant_graph op=delta were exercised from the source at M and the mutant source, using the plugin's warrant-mcp-call client and source-pinned server launchers (not the older installed server).

